          "label": "Rerun aborted",
          "value": "<p>The rerun of <b>{{conditionName}}</b> could not complete, so its file assets were left as they were.</p><p><b>Reason:</b> {{rerunAbortReason}}</p>",
          "defaultValue": false,
          "size": 12,
          "ignore": false,
          "visible": "{{rerunAborted}}",
          "enabled": true,
          "isRequired": false,
          "id": "rerunAbortedNote",
          "type": "htmlComponent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cols": [
        {
          "designInfo": {
            "stencilSuperIds": [
              "Output"
            ],
            "stencilId": "cloud-output"
          },
          "label": "Rerun complete",
          "value": "<p>The saved search <b>{{conditionName}}</b> was rerun and its file assets re-synced.</p><ul><li><b>Created:</b> {{importCreatedCount}} new file asset(s)</li><li><b>Updated:</b> {{importUpdatedCount}} existing file asset(s)</li><li><b>Unlinked:</b> {{rerunUnlinkedCount}} file(s) no longer returned by this search</li><li><b>Retired:</b> {{rerunRetiredCount}} file asset(s) no query returns any more (status Obsolete — kept as records, never deleted)</li><li><b>Stale classification links removed:</b> {{importRelationsRemovedCount}}</li><li><b>Failed:</b> {{importFailedCount}}</li><li><b>Unresolved classification links:</b> {{importSkippedClassifications}}</li></ul><p>The file assets live in the <b>Data X-Ray Files</b> domain. Full detail is in <code>dgc.log</code>. Click <b>Send</b> to close this task.</p>",
          "defaultValue": false,
          "size": 12,
          "ignore": false,
          "visible": true,
          "enabled": true,
          "isRequired": false,
          "id": "rerunSummary",
          "type": "htmlComponent"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "key": "rerunSummaryForm",
    "name": "Rerun Summary",
    "description": "Shows what the Data X-Ray search rerun created, updated, retired and failed.",
